sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Studio Owner
    participant Browser as Admin Dashboard
    participant API as Next.js API
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant Claude as Anthropic Claude
    participant Inngest as Inngest

    Note over Owner,Inngest: Primary Admin Flow

    Owner->>Browser: Login via magic link
    Browser->>API: GET /auth/callback
    API->>DB: Verify session
    DB-->>Browser: Session + profile
    Browser->>API: GET /api/ai/briefing
    API->>DB: Parallel: classes, transactions, members, credits, waitlist
    API->>Claude: Generate daily briefing
    Claude-->>API: Briefing text
    API->>DB: Cache in ai_briefings (30min TTL)
    API-->>Browser: Briefing + metrics

    Owner->>Browser: Click member
    Browser->>API: GET /api/members/[id]
    Browser->>API: POST /api/ai/churn-prediction
    API->>DB: Aggregate 90-day behavioral data
    API->>Claude: Predict churn risk
    Claude-->>API: Risk score + narrative
    API->>DB: Cache in ai_cache (24h TTL)
    API-->>Browser: ChurnPredictionResult

    Note over Inngest,DB: Background Automation Flow (every 10min)
    Inngest->>DB: Query active automation_flows
    Note right of DB: BUG: queries status='active'\nbut field is is_active BOOLEAN
    DB-->>Inngest: 0 flows returned (bug)
    Inngest->>Inngest: No enrollments created

    Note over Owner,DB: Campaign Send Flow
    Owner->>Browser: Create campaign
    Browser->>API: POST /api/campaigns
    Owner->>Browser: Send campaign
    Browser->>API: POST /api/campaigns/send
    API->>DB: Build recipient list from segment
    API->>DB: Insert campaign_recipients
    API->>API: Send via Resend API
    Note right of API: Async: Resend webhooks\nupdate delivery/open/click metrics
